# Keep the build context small — `apps/api/Dockerfile` (and any other
# Dockerfile in this repo) installs dependencies fresh inside the image via
# pnpm; none of this needs to be sent to the daemon.
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.next
.git
.github
.vscode
.claude
.agents
.ai
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
